<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English Sunday League</p>
<p>(40 overs) cricket matches:</p>
<p>At Arundel: Worcestershire beat Sussex by 49 runs.</p>
<p>Worcestershire 207-3 innings closed (D.Leatherdale 58 not out,</p>
<p>K.Spiring 58 not out). Sussex 158 in 38 overs.</p>
<p>At Chelmsford: Somerset beat Essex by four wickets. Essex</p>
<p>209-9 innings closed. Somerset 211-6 in 37.2 overs (M.Burns 83).</p>
<p>At Chester-le-Street: Hampshire beat Durham by six wickets.</p>
<p>Durham 162-9 innings closed (J.Lewis 51 not out; J.Stephenson</p>
<p>4-28). Hampshire 163-4 in 37 overs.</p>
<p>At Leicester: Leicestershire v Yorkshire match tied.</p>
<p>Leicestershire 298-9 innings closed (D.Maddy 70, J.Whitaker 66,</p>
<p>V.Wells 51; A.Morris 4-49). Yorkshire 298-9 innings closed</p>
<p>(C.White 148).</p>
<p>At Swansea: Gloucestershire beat Glamorgan by 17 runs.</p>
<p>Gloucestershire 236-7 innings closed (A.Wright 69, T.Hancock</p>
<p>57). Glamorgan 219-7 innings closed (S.James 75 not out; M.Ball</p>
<p>4-26).</p>
<p>At Maidstone: Kent beat Northamptonshire by two runs. Kent</p>
<p>209-8 innings closed. Northamptonshire 207-9 innings closed</p>
<p>(R.Bailey 54).</p>
<p>At Edgbaston: Warwickshire beat Surrey by 48 runs.</p>
<p>Warwickshire 231-6 innings closed (D.Ostler 58). Surrey 183-9</p>
<p>innings closed (A.Hollioake 50).</p>
<p>At Uxbridge: Middlesex v Lancashire match tied. Middlesex</p>
<p>197 (J.Pooley 73). Lancashire 197-9 innings closed</p>
<p>(N.Fairbrother 70).</p>
</text>
